{% comment %}
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  "Botón Contra Entrega (GLOZ)" — reemplazo de Releasit COD Form & Upsells.

  Cómo funciona (en simple):
  - Se agrega UNA vez en la página de producto (o en la plantilla `product.json`)
    y funciona AUTOMÁTICO en TODOS los productos de la tienda: lee la variante y
    el precio de la página actual. NO hay que configurar nada por producto.
  - Muestra un BOTÓN. Al hacer clic, abre un POPUP (modal) con el formulario.
  - Todo lo que ves dentro del popup (título, ofertas, campos, botones,
    garantía, productos extra…) son BLOQUES de esta sección: los agregas,
    quitas y REORDENAS desde el Editor de temas, con el sistema nativo de
    Shopify (el mismo con el que reordenas cualquier sección).
  - Los colores, tipografía, animación, radio de esquinas, etc. se configuran
    en los ajustes de la sección — sin tocar código.

  El JS NO lee este archivo directamente: leemos `section.blocks` aquí abajo y
  lo volcamos a un <script type="application/json"> en el ORDEN exacto en que
  aparecen los bloques; `cod-form-gloz.js` arma el popup a partir de esos datos.

  IMPORTANTE — precio: `variant.price`/`variant.compare_at_price` en Liquid
  vienen en la SUBUNIDAD de la moneda (p. ej. $79.990 COP = 7999000), tal como
  documenta Shopify (shopify.dev/docs/api/liquid/objects/money). Por eso aquí
  SIEMPRE se dividen entre 100 antes de mandarlos al JS — así el popup muestra
  el precio REAL, no inflado.
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'cod-form-gloz.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- if product -%}
  {%- assign v = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
  {%- assign s = section.settings -%}

  {%- comment %} ── Precio REAL (la subunidad de Liquid siempre se divide /100) ── {%- endcomment %}
  {%- assign v_price = v.price | divided_by: 100.0 -%}
  {%- assign v_compare = 0 -%}
  {%- if v.compare_at_price and v.compare_at_price > v.price -%}
    {%- assign v_compare = v.compare_at_price | divided_by: 100.0 -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment %} ── Velocidad de animación en ms según el select ── {%- endcomment %}
  {%- assign anim_ms = 220 -%}
  {%- if s.animation_speed == 'rapida' -%}{%- assign anim_ms = 140 -%}
  {%- elsif s.animation_speed == 'lenta' -%}{%- assign anim_ms = 340 -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment %} ── Escala de tipografía ── {%- endcomment %}
  {%- assign font_scale_val = 1 -%}
  {%- if s.font_scale == 'sm' -%}{%- assign font_scale_val = 0.92 -%}
  {%- elsif s.font_scale == 'lg' -%}{%- assign font_scale_val = 1.1 -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment %} ── Escala de densidad/espaciado ── {%- endcomment %}
  {%- assign space_scale_val = 1 -%}
  {%- if s.density == 'compact' -%}{%- assign space_scale_val = 0.8 -%}
  {%- elsif s.density == 'relaxed' -%}{%- assign space_scale_val = 1.2 -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment %} ── Radio de los campos según el contorno elegido ── {%- endcomment %}
  {%- assign field_radius_px = 14 -%}
  {%- if s.field_contour == 'rect' -%}{%- assign field_radius_px = 8 -%}
  {%- elsif s.field_contour == 'oval' -%}{%- assign field_radius_px = 999 -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment %}
    ── Sombra del botón de afuera (trigger) ──
    Misma fórmula que usa el JS para los botones de adentro: blur = px elegido,
    offset ≈ 36% del blur, opacidad fija suave. 0 = sin sombra.
  {%- endcomment %}
  {%- assign t_shadow = s.trigger_shadow | default: 22 -%}
  {%- if t_shadow > 0 -%}
    {%- assign t_offset = t_shadow | times: 36 | divided_by: 100 -%}
    {%- capture t_shadow_css -%}0 {{ t_offset }}px {{ t_shadow }}px rgba(0,0,0,0.16){%- endcapture -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- assign t_shadow_css = 'none' -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  <div
    class="gloz-cod-block"
    id="gloz-cod-{{ section.id }}"
    style="
      --gloz-trigger-bg:{{ s.trigger_bg }};
      --gloz-trigger-text:{{ s.trigger_text_color }};
      --gloz-trigger-border:{{ s.trigger_border_color | default: s.trigger_bg }};
      --gloz-trigger-border-w:{{ s.trigger_border_width | default: 0 }}px;
      --gloz-trigger-radius:{{ s.trigger_radius | default: 20 }}px;
      --gloz-trigger-font:{{ s.trigger_font_size | default: 17 }}px;
      --gloz-trigger-section-bg:{{ s.trigger_section_bg }};
      --gloz-trigger-shadow:{{ t_shadow_css }};
      --gloz-radius:{{ s.corner_radius }}px;
      --gloz-font-scale:{{ font_scale_val }};
      --gloz-space-scale:{{ space_scale_val }};
    "
  >
    {%- comment %}
      Si "Mostrar el botón que abre el formulario" está apagado, NO se renderiza
      el botón por defecto (Felix conecta sus propios botones/sticky/ofertas
      con data-gloz-open). El popup y `window.glozCOD` siguen activos igual:
      el <script> de datos y el `cod-form-gloz.js` se cargan siempre, más abajo.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if s.show_trigger != false -%}
      <button
        type="button"
        class="gloz-cod-trigger gloz-cod-trigger--{{ s.button_style }} gloz-cod-trigger--{{ s.button_size }} gloz-trig-anim-{{ s.trigger_anim_style | default: 'none' }}"
        data-gloz-cod-trigger
        {% if s.trigger_full_width == false %}style="width:auto;display:inline-flex;"{% endif %}
      >
        {%- if s.trigger_icon != 'none' -%}<span class="gloz-trig-ic" data-gloz-icon="{{ s.trigger_icon }}"></span>{%- endif -%}
        <span class="gloz-trig-textcol">
          <span class="gloz-trig-maintext">{{ s.trigger_text }}</span>
          {%- if s.trigger_subtitle != blank -%}<span class="gloz-trig-subtext">{{ s.trigger_subtitle }}</span>{%- endif -%}
        </span>
      </button>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    Colores que ahora viven DENTRO de su bloque (ofertas / botón COD / pago
    anticipado). Se capturan aquí para meterlos en el objeto "theme" que lee el
    JS, sin cambiar el JS. Si el bloque no está o el color está vacío, se usa el
    valor por defecto.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign th_offer_sel_bg = '#EAF3EF' -%}
  {%- assign th_offer_sel_border = '#2E6E5A' -%}
  {%- assign th_badge_bg = '#E8912D' -%}
  {%- assign th_badge_text = '#1A1400' -%}
  {%- assign th_cta_bg = '#14342B' -%}
  {%- assign th_cta_text = '#FFFFFF' -%}
  {%- assign th_prepaid = '#2E6E5A' -%}
  {%- for b in section.blocks -%}
    {%- if b.type == 'offers' -%}
      {%- if b.settings.offer_selected_bg != blank -%}{%- assign th_offer_sel_bg = b.settings.offer_selected_bg -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- if b.settings.offer_selected_border != blank -%}{%- assign th_offer_sel_border = b.settings.offer_selected_border -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- if b.settings.badge_bg != blank -%}{%- assign th_badge_bg = b.settings.badge_bg -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- if b.settings.badge_text != blank -%}{%- assign th_badge_text = b.settings.badge_text -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- elsif b.type == 'cod_button' -%}
      {%- if b.settings.bg != blank -%}{%- assign th_cta_bg = b.settings.bg -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- if b.settings.text_color != blank -%}{%- assign th_cta_text = b.settings.text_color -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}

  {%- comment %}
    ── Datos de la sección para el JS (en el orden real de section.blocks) ──
    Todo lo que el popup necesita: URL del backend, producto/variante actual,
    tema visual completo y la lista de bloques con sus settings.
  {%- endcomment %}
  <script type="application/json" id="gloz-cod-data-{{ section.id }}">
  {
    "sectionId": {{ section.id | json }},
    "apiUrl": {{ s.api_url | json }},
    "shop": {{ shop.permanent_domain | json }},
    "currency": {{ cart.currency.iso_code | json }},
    "product": {
      "variantId": {{ v.id | json }},
      "price": {{ v_price | json }},
      "compareAtPrice": {% if v_compare > 0 %}{{ v_compare | json }}{% else %}null{% endif %},
      "title": {{ product.title | json }},
      "image": {% if product.featured_image %}{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 200 | json }}{% else %}null{% endif %},
      "url": {{ product.url | json }},
      "variants": [
        {%- comment %} Solo se usa si el producto tiene MÁS DE UNA variante (el JS decide si muestra el selector). Precio siempre /100 (ver nota de subunidad arriba). {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- for pv in product.variants -%}
          { "id": {{ pv.id | json }}, "title": {{ pv.title | json }}, "available": {{ pv.available | json }}, "price": {{ pv.price | divided_by: 100.0 | json }} }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
        {%- endfor -%}
      ]
    },
    "pixels": {
      "metaEnabled": {{ s.meta_enabled | json }},
      "metaPixelId": {{ s.meta_pixel_id | json }},
      "tiktokEnabled": {{ s.tiktok_enabled | json }},
      "tiktokPixelId": {{ s.tiktok_pixel_id | json }}
    },
    "theme": {
      "preset": {{ s.theme_preset | default: 'personalizado' | json }},
      "popupBg": {{ s.popup_bg | json }},
      "textColor": {{ s.text_color | json }},
      "mutedTextColor": {{ s.muted_text_color | json }},
      "borderColor": {{ s.border_color | json }},
      "accentColor": {{ s.accent_color | json }},
      "offerSelectedBg": {{ th_offer_sel_bg | json }},
      "offerSelectedBorder": {{ th_offer_sel_border | json }},
      "badgeBg": {{ th_badge_bg | json }},
      "badgeText": {{ th_badge_text | json }},
      "ctaBg": {{ th_cta_bg | json }},
      "ctaText": {{ th_cta_text | json }},
      "prepaidColor": {{ th_prepaid | json }},
      "errorColor": {{ s.error_color | json }},
      "overlayColor": {{ s.overlay_color | json }},
      "overlayOpacity": {{ s.overlay_opacity | json }},
      "overlayBlur": {{ s.overlay_blur | json }},
      "inheritThemeFont": {{ s.inherit_theme_font | json }},
      "fontScale": {{ font_scale_val | json }},
      "labelFontSize": {{ s.label_font_size | json }},
      "labelColor": {{ s.label_color | json }},
      "headingWeight": {{ s.heading_weight | json }},
      "cornerRadius": {{ s.corner_radius | json }},
      "spaceScale": {{ space_scale_val | json }},
      "showHeader": {{ s.show_header | json }},
      "fieldRadius": {{ field_radius_px | json }},
      "fieldShadow": {{ s.field_shadow | default: 0 | json }},
      "buttonStyle": {{ s.button_style | json }},
      "buttonSize": {{ s.button_size | json }},
      "enableAnimations": {{ s.enable_animations | json }},
      "entranceStyle": {{ s.entrance_style | json }},
      "animationMs": {{ anim_ms | json }},
      "enableHoverFx": {{ s.enable_hover_fx | json }},
      "successSize": {{ s.success_size | json }},
      "noticeSize": {{ s.notice_size | json }}
    },
    "texts": {
      "submitting": {{ s.submitting_text | json }},
      "successTitle": {{ s.success_title | json }},
      "successBody": {{ s.success_body | json }},
      "errorGeneric": {{ s.error_generic_text | json }},
      "closeLabel": {{ s.close_label | json }}
    },
    "blocks": [
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {
          "type": {{ block.type | json }},
          "id": {{ block.id | json }},
          {%- comment -%}
            Nota técnica: cada tipo de bloque vuelca sus settings EXPLÍCITAMENTE
            (`block.settings.xxx`) en vez de iterar `block.settings` como hash
            genérico. Es más código, pero es la forma 100% garantizada de leer
            settings en Liquid real de Shopify (la iteración genérica de hashes
            de settings no siempre se comporta igual entre temas/versiones).
          {%- endcomment -%}
          "settings": {
            {%- case block.type -%}
              {%- when 'product_header' -%}
                "show_image": {{ block.settings.show_image | json }},
                "show_price": {{ block.settings.show_price | json }},
                "title_override": {{ block.settings.title_override | json }},
                "title_size": {{ block.settings.title_size | json }},
                "title_color": {{ block.settings.title_color | json }},
                "align": {{ block.settings.align | json }}
              {%- when 'title' -%}
                "heading": {{ block.settings.heading | json }},
                "title_size": {{ block.settings.title_size | json }},
                "title_color": {{ block.settings.title_color | json }},
                "subheading": {{ block.settings.subheading | json }},
                "subtitle_size": {{ block.settings.subtitle_size | json }},
                "subtitle_color": {{ block.settings.subtitle_color | json }},
                "show_product_thumb": {{ block.settings.show_product_thumb | json }},
                "align": {{ block.settings.align | json }}
              {%- when 'offers' -%}
                "offers_title": {{ block.settings.offers_title | json }},
                "offers_title_enabled": {{ block.settings.offers_title_enabled | json }},
                "offers_title_size": {{ block.settings.offers_title_size | json }},
                "offers_title_color": {{ block.settings.offers_title_color | json }},
                "show_compare_at": {{ block.settings.show_compare_at | json }},
                "show_per_unit": {{ block.settings.show_per_unit | json }},
                "offer_bg": {{ block.settings.offer_bg | json }},
                "offer_border_color": {{ block.settings.offer_border_color | json }},
                "offer_radius": {{ block.settings.offer_radius | json }},
                "badge_style": {{ block.settings.badge_style | json }},
                "badge_text_color": {{ block.settings.badge_text_color | json }},
                "badge_text_size": {{ block.settings.badge_text_size | json }},
                "badge_anim": {{ block.settings.badge_anim | json }},
                "offer_anim_enabled": {{ block.settings.offer_anim_enabled | json }},
                "offer_name_size": {{ block.settings.offer_name_size | json }},
                "offer_name_color": {{ block.settings.offer_name_color | json }},
                "offer_price_size": {{ block.settings.offer_price_size | json }},
                "offer_price_color": {{ block.settings.offer_price_color | json }},
                "offer_per_unit_size": {{ block.settings.offer_per_unit_size | json }},
                "offer_per_unit_color": {{ block.settings.offer_per_unit_color | json }},
                "note_size": {{ block.settings.note_size | json }},
                "note_bg": {{ block.settings.note_bg | json }},
                "note_color": {{ block.settings.note_color | json }},

                "offer1_enabled": {{ block.settings.offer1_enabled | json }},
                "offer1_units": {{ block.settings.offer1_units | json }},
                "offer1_label": {{ block.settings.offer1_label | json }},
                "offer1_discount_type": {{ block.settings.offer1_discount_type | json }},
                "offer1_discount": {{ block.settings.offer1_discount | json }},
                "offer1_fixed_price": {{ block.settings.offer1_fixed_price | json }},
                "offer1_badge": {{ block.settings.offer1_badge | json }},
                "offer1_default": {{ block.settings.offer1_default | json }},
                "offer1_note": {{ block.settings.offer1_note | json }},
                "offer1_image_url": {{ block.settings.offer1_image_url | json }},

                "offer2_enabled": {{ block.settings.offer2_enabled | json }},
                "offer2_units": {{ block.settings.offer2_units | json }},
                "offer2_label": {{ block.settings.offer2_label | json }},
                "offer2_discount_type": {{ block.settings.offer2_discount_type | json }},
                "offer2_discount": {{ block.settings.offer2_discount | json }},
                "offer2_fixed_price": {{ block.settings.offer2_fixed_price | json }},
                "offer2_badge": {{ block.settings.offer2_badge | json }},
                "offer2_default": {{ block.settings.offer2_default | json }},
                "offer2_note": {{ block.settings.offer2_note | json }},
                "offer2_image_url": {{ block.settings.offer2_image_url | json }},

                "offer3_enabled": {{ block.settings.offer3_enabled | json }},
                "offer3_units": {{ block.settings.offer3_units | json }},
                "offer3_label": {{ block.settings.offer3_label | json }},
                "offer3_discount_type": {{ block.settings.offer3_discount_type | json }},
                "offer3_discount": {{ block.settings.offer3_discount | json }},
                "offer3_fixed_price": {{ block.settings.offer3_fixed_price | json }},
                "offer3_badge": {{ block.settings.offer3_badge | json }},
                "offer3_default": {{ block.settings.offer3_default | json }},
                "offer3_note": {{ block.settings.offer3_note | json }},
                "offer3_image_url": {{ block.settings.offer3_image_url | json }},

                "offer4_enabled": {{ block.settings.offer4_enabled | json }},
                "offer4_units": {{ block.settings.offer4_units | json }},
                "offer4_label": {{ block.settings.offer4_label | json }},
                "offer4_discount_type": {{ block.settings.offer4_discount_type | json }},
                "offer4_discount": {{ block.settings.offer4_discount | json }},
                "offer4_fixed_price": {{ block.settings.offer4_fixed_price | json }},
                "offer4_badge": {{ block.settings.offer4_badge | json }},
                "offer4_default": {{ block.settings.offer4_default | json }},
                "offer4_note": {{ block.settings.offer4_note | json }},
                "offer4_image_url": {{ block.settings.offer4_image_url | json }}
              {%- when 'field_name' or 'field_lastname' or 'field_phone' or 'field_address' or 'field_email' or 'field_extra' -%}
                "label": {{ block.settings.label | json }},
                "placeholder": {{ block.settings.placeholder | json }},
                "required": {{ block.settings.required | json }}
              {%- when 'field_variant' -%}
                "label": {{ block.settings.label | json }},
                "per_unit": {{ block.settings.per_unit | json }},
                "contour": {{ block.settings.contour | json }},
                "shadow": {{ block.settings.shadow | json }},
                "font_size": {{ block.settings.font_size | json }},
                "text_color": {{ block.settings.text_color | json }}
              {%- when 'field_location' -%}
                "label_department": {{ block.settings.label_department | json }},
                "placeholder_department": {{ block.settings.placeholder_department | json }},
                "label_city": {{ block.settings.label_city | json }},
                "placeholder_city": {{ block.settings.placeholder_city | json }}
              {%- when 'image' -%}
                "image_url": {{ block.settings.image_url | json }},
                "image_asset": {% if block.settings.image %}{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 800 | json }}{% else %}null{% endif %},
                "alt": {{ block.settings.alt | json }},
                "radius": {{ block.settings.radius | json }},
                "max_width": {{ block.settings.max_width | json }}
              {%- when 'custom_text' -%}
                "heading": {{ block.settings.heading | json }},
                "body": {{ block.settings.body | json }},
                "text_color": {{ block.settings.text_color | json }},
                "align": {{ block.settings.align | json }},
                "size": {{ block.settings.size | json }}
              {%- when 'cod_button' -%}
                "text": {{ block.settings.text | json }},
                "subtitle": {{ block.settings.subtitle | json }},
                "helper_text": {{ block.settings.helper_text | json }},
                "icon": {{ block.settings.icon | json }},
                "bg": {{ block.settings.bg | json }},
                "text_color": {{ block.settings.text_color | json }},
                "border_color": {{ block.settings.border_color | json }},
                "border_width": {{ block.settings.border_width | json }},
                "radius": {{ block.settings.radius | json }},
                "font_size": {{ block.settings.font_size | json }},
                "shadow": {{ block.settings.shadow | default: 0 | json }},
                "anim_style": {{ block.settings.anim_style | json }}
              {%- when 'prepaid_button' -%}
                "text": {{ block.settings.text | json }},
                "subtitle": {{ block.settings.subtitle | json }},
                "divider_text": {{ block.settings.divider_text | json }},
                "helper_text": {{ block.settings.helper_text | json }},
                "icon": {{ block.settings.icon | json }},
                "fill_style": {{ block.settings.fill_style | json }},
                "bg": {{ block.settings.bg | json }},
                "text_color": {{ block.settings.text_color | json }},
                "border_color": {{ block.settings.border_color | json }},
                "border_width": {{ block.settings.border_width | json }},
                "radius": {{ block.settings.radius | json }},
                "font_size": {{ block.settings.font_size | json }},
                "shadow": {{ block.settings.shadow | default: 0 | json }},
                "anim_style": {{ block.settings.anim_style | json }}
              {%- when 'upsell' -%}
                "label_override": {{ block.settings.label_override | json }},
                "visible_to_customer": {{ block.settings.visible_to_customer | json }},
                "discount_type": {{ block.settings.discount_type | json }},
                "discount": {{ block.settings.discount | json }},
                "fixed_price": {{ block.settings.fixed_price | json }},
                "default_checked": {{ block.settings.default_checked | json }},
                "show_price": {{ block.settings.show_price | json }},
                "show_image": {{ block.settings.show_image | json }},
                "image_url": {{ block.settings.image_url | json }},
                "border_color": {{ block.settings.border_color | json }},
                "radius": {{ block.settings.radius | json }},
                {%- comment -%}
                  "variant_id": para productos que Felix saca del canal
                  "Tienda online" a propósito (kits ocultos). Cuando el
                  producto está fuera del canal, `block.settings.product`
                  llega `nil` en Liquid (el product picker/objeto global está
                  limitado al canal actual) — por eso "product" abajo es
                  SIEMPRE a prueba de nil (nunca genera JSON inválido) y el JS
                  usa este "variant_id" manual como respaldo, resolviendo
                  título/precio/imagen reales contra el backend
                  (GET /variant-info, que sí ve productos fuera de canal).
                {%- endcomment -%}
                "variant_id": {{ block.settings.variant_id | json }},
                "product": {%- assign up = block.settings.product -%}
                  {%- assign upv = blank -%}
                  {%- if up -%}{%- assign upv = up.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}{%- endif -%}
                  {%- if up and upv -%}
                    {%- assign upv_price = upv.price | divided_by: 100.0 -%}
                    {%- assign upv_compare = 0 -%}
                    {%- if upv.compare_at_price and upv.compare_at_price > upv.price -%}
                      {%- assign upv_compare = upv.compare_at_price | divided_by: 100.0 -%}
                    {%- endif -%}
                    {
                      "variantId": {{ upv.id | json }},
                      "title": {{ up.title | json }},
                      "price": {{ upv_price | json }},
                      "compareAtPrice": {% if upv_compare > 0 %}{{ upv_compare | json }}{% else %}null{% endif %},
                      "image": {% if up.featured_image %}{{ up.featured_image | image_url: width: 160 | json }}{% else %}null{% endif %},
                      "available": {{ upv.available | json }}
                    }
                  {%- else -%}
                    null
                  {%- endif -%}
              {%- when 'guarantee' -%}
                "text": {{ block.settings.text | json }},
                "icon": {{ block.settings.icon | json }},
                "style": {{ block.settings.style | json }},
                "text_size": {{ block.settings.text_size | json }},
                "color": {{ block.settings.color | json }},
                "animate": {{ block.settings.animate | json }}
              {%- when 'trust_text' -%}
                "text": {{ block.settings.text | json }},
                "align": {{ block.settings.align | json }},
                "style": {{ block.settings.style | json }},
                "color": {{ block.settings.color | json }},
                "animate": {{ block.settings.animate | json }},
                "item1_icon": {{ block.settings.item1_icon | json }},
                "item1_text": {{ block.settings.item1_text | json }},
                "item2_icon": {{ block.settings.item2_icon | json }},
                "item2_text": {{ block.settings.item2_text | json }},
                "item3_icon": {{ block.settings.item3_icon | json }},
                "item3_text": {{ block.settings.item3_text | json }}
              {%- when 'scarcity' -%}
                "mode": {{ block.settings.mode | json }},
                "timer_minutes": {{ block.settings.timer_minutes | json }},
                "text_template": {{ block.settings.text_template | json }},
                "style": {{ block.settings.style | json }},
                "accent_color": {{ block.settings.accent_color | json }},
                "bg_color": {{ block.settings.bg_color | json }},
                "text_color": {{ block.settings.text_color | json }},
                "show_icon": {{ block.settings.show_icon | json }}
              {%- when 'summary' -%}
                "title": {{ block.settings.title | json }}
              {%- when 'downsell' -%}
                "enable": {{ block.settings.enable | json }},
                "title": {{ block.settings.title | json }},
                "text": {{ block.settings.text | json }},
                "label_override": {{ block.settings.label_override | json }},
                "button_text": {{ block.settings.button_text | json }},
                "decline_text": {{ block.settings.decline_text | json }},
                "discount_type": {{ block.settings.discount_type | json }},
                "discount": {{ block.settings.discount | json }},
                "fixed_price": {{ block.settings.fixed_price | json }},
                "show_image": {{ block.settings.show_image | json }},
                "image_url": {{ block.settings.image_url | json }},
                "variant_id": {{ block.settings.variant_id | json }},
                "product": {%- assign ds = block.settings.product -%}
                  {%- assign dsv = blank -%}
                  {%- if ds -%}{%- assign dsv = ds.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}{%- endif -%}
                  {%- if ds and dsv -%}
                    {%- assign dsv_price = dsv.price | divided_by: 100.0 -%}
                    {
                      "variantId": {{ dsv.id | json }},
                      "title": {{ ds.title | json }},
                      "price": {{ dsv_price | json }},
                      "image": {% if ds.featured_image %}{{ ds.featured_image | image_url: width: 200 | json }}{% else %}null{% endif %},
                      "available": {{ dsv.available | json }}
                    }
                  {%- else -%}
                    null
                  {%- endif -%}
            {%- endcase -%}
          }
        }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
      {%- endfor -%}
    ]
  }
  </script>

  <script src="{{ 'cod-form-gloz.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
{%- endif -%}

